WEBVTT

00:11:29.496 --> 00:11:32.912
and feminine norms, the number
one shame trigger is.

00:11:34.162 --> 00:11:39.121
Perfection do not be perceived as
imperfect, do it all, do it.

00:11:39.162 --> 00:11:41.121
Well, never let them see you sweat.

00:11:41.621 --> 00:11:45.871
So now I'm saying, hey, I want you to
be vulnerable about your setbacks

00:11:45.871 --> 00:11:49.621
and your failures and where you're
struggling and your emotions.

00:11:50.121 --> 00:11:55.454
So really the biggest barrier
to vulnerability.

00:11:56.537 --> 00:11:59.829
Is shame the fear of shame?